ed in 2025, having a breakout season while becoming a starter on the Sooners' defensive line. Against South Carolina, Wein recorded four tackles, two tackles for loss, and his first career interception. Against No. 4 Alabama, he totaled three tackles, a sack, and forced fumble, while also blocking a field goal in a 23–21 victory."}]}}